egendary cars, and carve your name into history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/dc68ce2471e812bb2dd251540821b32f.poster.avif?t=1785158997\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/dc68ce2471e812bb2dd251540821b32f.webm?t=1785158997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/dc68ce2471e812bb2dd251540821b32f.mp4?t=1785158997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE &amp; COMPETE</strong> - Create your own custom races and championships, climb the global leaderboards in Time Attack, and personalize your ride with modding support—from liveries to helmets and trackside sponsors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/bc0b4abe847169c0684bb7350a0ea6b1.poster.avif?t=1785158997\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/bc0b4abe847169c0684bb7350a0ea6b1.webm?t=1785158997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/bc0b4abe847169c0684bb7350a0ea6b1.mp4?t=1785158997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
